 font-weight:normal!important; color:#212121!important; text-align:left!important; word-wrap:break-word!important\"><div style=\"background:revert!important; border:revert!important; bottom:revert!important; color:revert!important; direction:revert!important; display:revert!important; font-size:revert!important; height:revert!important; letter-spacing:revert!important; line-height:revert!important; margin:revert!important; opacity:revert!important; order:revert!important; outline:revert!important; overflow:revert!important; padding:revert!important; position:revert!important; tab-size:revert!important; table-layout:revert!important; text-align:revert!important; text-indent:revert!important; text-orientation:revert!important; text-overflow:revert!important; text-transform:revert!important; top:revert!important; vertical-align:revert!important; visibility:revert!important; white-space:revert!important; width:revert!important; word-break:revert!important; word-spacing:revert!important; writing-mode:revert!important; zoom:revert!important\">yongchoolkim@microsoft.com에게서 전자 메일을 받지 못하는 경우가 많습니다. <a href=\"https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification\" style=\"background:revert!important; color:revert!important; direction:revert!important; display:revert!important; font-size:revert!important; opacity:revert!important; visibility:revert!important\">이 문제가 중요한 이유</a> </div></td><td valign=\"middle\" align=\"left\" width=\"75px\" bgcolor=\"#EAEAEA\" cellpadding=\"7px 5px 7px 5px\" color=\"#212121\" style=\"background:revert!important; border:revert!important; bottom:revert!important; color:revert!important; direction:revert!important; display:revert!important; font-size:revert!important; height:revert!important; letter-spacing:revert!important; line-height:revert!important; margin:revert!important; opacity:revert!important; order:revert!important; outline:revert!important; overflow:revert!important; padding:revert!important; position:revert!important; tab-size:revert!important; table-layout:revert!important; text-align:revert!important; text-indent:revert!important; text-orientation:revert!important; text-overflow:revert!important; text-transform:revert!important; top:revert!important; vertical-align:revert!important; visibility:revert!important; white-space:revert!important; width:revert!important; word-break:revert!important; word-spacing:revert!important; writing-mode:revert!important; zoom:revert!important; width:75px!important; background-color:#EAEAEA!important; padding:7px 5px 7px 5px!important; font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal,Segoe UI,Segoe WP,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif!important; font-size:12px!important; font-weight:normal!important; color:#212121!important; text-align:left!important; word-wrap:break-word!important\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">안녕하세요 김동헌 님<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">마이크로소프트 김용출 입니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">답변 및 확인 감사드리며<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>정상적&#51004;로<span lang=\"EN-US\"> VM </span>재배포되어서 다행입니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">더워지는 날씨에 건강 유의하시기 바라며<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>마이크로소프트 기술지원에 문의해 주셔서 감사합니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">문의하신 내용에 대하여 다음과 같이 정리하며<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>해당 문의는 종료하도록 하겠습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">지원드린 케이스 내에서 추가로 궁금하신 사항이 있&#51004;시면<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>케이스 재 오픈을 요청하실 수 있습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">해당 문의 종료 후에는 지원과 관련하여 고객님의 소중한 의견을 묻는 간단한 웹 설문을 받&#51004;실 수 있습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">시간을 내 주셔서 설문에 응해 주시면 &#54588;드백을 반영하여 마이크로소프트 기술 지원 서비스를 지속적&#51004;로 향상시키는 데에 소중하게 이용하도록 하겠습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">또한 지원과 관련한 &#54588;드백과 경험을 직접 전달하고 싶&#51004;신 경우 저희 팀 매니저와 논의하실 수 있습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">아래는 케이스 진행 내역의 요약입니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; background:white; text-autospace:ideograph-other\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color:black\">- </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color:black\">문의사항 <span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color:black\">Standard M832ixs&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color:black\">타입<span lang=\"EN-US\"> VM</span>의 재배포를 위한 여유 분량 확인 건</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:inherit\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"897\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:672.75pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt\"><p style=\"margin:0cm; text-autospace:ideograph-other\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">금일 중<span lang=\"EN-US\"> VM&nbsp;</span>재배포 필요 상황에서 해당<span lang=\"EN-US\"> VM&nbsp;</span>스펙 여유 분량이 되는지 확인 부탁드립니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; text-autospace:ideograph-other\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; text-autospace:ideograph-other\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">현재 해당<span lang=\"EN-US\"> VM</span>의 경우<span lang=\"EN-US\"> Standard M832ixs(832</span>개<span lang=\"EN-US\"> vcpu, 14902GiB&nbsp;</span>메모리<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>를 사용하고 있습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; text-autospace:ideograph-other\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">해당<span lang=\"EN-US\"> VM</span>을 재배포 할 경우 해당 스펙 만큼의 여유 분량이 확보되어 재배포가 특이사항 없이 진행 될 수 있는지 확인이 필요합니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none; word-break:break-hangul\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; background:white; text-autospace:ideograph-other\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color:black\">- </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color:black\">답변내용 <span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color:#242424\">유선&#51004;로 해당<span lang=\"EN-US\"> VM</span>의<span lang=\"EN-US\"> Host&nbsp;</span>장비가<span lang=\"EN-US\"> degraded&nbsp;</span>상태가 확인되어서 금일<span lang=\"EN-US\">(7</span>월<span lang=\"EN-US\">31</span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\">)&nbsp;</span>재배포 진행이 필요하신 것&#51004;로 이해했습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; background:white; text-autospace:ideograph-other\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color:#242424\">현재 한국 중부 지역내<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color:black\">Standard M832ixs&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color:black\">타입에 대해서<span lang=\"EN-US\"> Capacity</span>는 존재하는 것&#51004;로 확인됩니다<span lang=\"EN